<title>UK: De La Rue names Brandon Gough chairman.</title>
<headline>De La Rue names Brandon Gough chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British banknote printer De La Rue Plc said on Wednesday the Earl of Limerick would retire as the company's chairman and be succeeded by Brandon Gough.  </p>
<p>Gough, currently chairman of Yorkshire Water Plc, joined the board of De La Rue as a non-executive director in February 1994.</p>
<p>Lord Limerick was set to retire at the company's annual general meeting on July 23.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
